{
    "title": "Wasteland Life: Survival Idle",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf0d<b>IT'S A TOUGH WORLD OUT THERE</b>\ud83c\udf0b\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ve barely survived\u2026 As you look out across the post-apocalyptic desert landscape, you realize that your survival hinges on both resource management and strategic thinking skills if you want to master these harsh conditions. Construct buildings and cities from the ground up in this fun, idle-style game as you test various strategies to see which will get you the furthest.\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udcdc<b>NO PLAN SURVIVES CONTACT WITH THE ENEMY</b>\ud83d\udcdc\r\n\r\nWhile you may not have to fight off roving packs of zombies or other classic enemies in this game, you will need to keep your wits about you as you navigate the deserted desert\u2026 Or is it deserted?\r\nYou may not be as alone as you think you are.\r\n\r\nHoovers at the ready \u2013 Boy this sand is everywhere! Locate a vacuum and get to cleaning. As you remove the sand, not only will you clear territory that will be useful for your future cities, but you\u2019ll also uncover tons of forgotten junk and appliances. One man\u2019s trash is another man\u2019s treasure, so collect anything and everything you stumble across \u2013 it might be useful.\r\n\r\nLet\u2019s get crafty \u2013 Remember all that junk you collected? Use it to fix broken bridges, build houses, and more; the possibilities are practically endless! Even the sand can be collected and used to make things, so make sure you always keep a good stock of resources and never give up an opportunity to collect more.\r\n\r\nFun in the sun \u2013 Whether you have just a few minutes or a longer stretch of time to kill, you\u2019ll always have time to hop in the game and make some solid progress. The benefit of this being an idle game is that you\u2019ll be making progress even when you can\u2019t be online so there\u2019s no pressure. Just sit back, relax, and imagine how you\u2019ll build your future empire.\r\n\r\nIdle but energetic \u2013 While Wasteland Life is heavy on idle game play and resource collection, there\u2019s plenty of excitement as well for players who are looking for something a little more engaging. Head out on expeditions to collect fabulous resources, as these are what will really make or break your ability to sustain your city. But be careful, you don\u2019t know what all awaits you out in the wasteland\u2026\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f<b>CAN YOU SURVIVE THE TEST OF TIME</b>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f\r\n\r\nThis simulation game sure will test your survival instincts to the max, as you struggle to not only survive, but thrive in this deserted wasteland that was once our planet. Draw up your best strategy and get to work uncovering the land bit by bit, collecting valuable resources along the way that can be used to build houses, settlements, and even cities. Download Wasteland Life now to embark on a thrilling journey of survival and discovery!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf0d<b>IT&#39;S A TOUGH WORLD OUT THERE</b>\ud83c\udf0b<br><br>You\u2019ve barely survived\u2026 As you look out across the post-apocalyptic desert landscape, you realize that your survival hinges on both resource management and strategic thinking skills if you want to master these harsh conditions. Construct buildings and cities from the ground up in this fun, idle-style game as you test various strategies to see which will get you the furthest.<br> <br>\ud83d\udcdc<b>NO PLAN SURVIVES CONTACT WITH THE ENEMY</b>\ud83d\udcdc<br><br>While you may not have to fight off roving packs of zombies or other classic enemies in this game, you will need to keep your wits about you as you navigate the deserted desert\u2026 Or is it deserted?<br>You may not be as alone as you think you are.<br><br>Hoovers at the ready \u2013 Boy this sand is everywhere! Locate a vacuum and get to cleaning. As you remove the sand, not only will you clear territory that will be useful for your future cities, but you\u2019ll also uncover tons of forgotten junk and appliances. One man\u2019s trash is another man\u2019s treasure, so collect anything and everything you stumble across \u2013 it might be useful.<br><br>Let\u2019s get crafty \u2013 Remember all that junk you collected? Use it to fix broken bridges, build houses, and more; the possibilities are practically endless! Even the sand can be collected and used to make things, so make sure you always keep a good stock of resources and never give up an opportunity to collect more.<br><br>Fun in the sun \u2013 Whether you have just a few minutes or a longer stretch of time to kill, you\u2019ll always have time to hop in the game and make some solid progress. The benefit of this being an idle game is that you\u2019ll be making progress even when you can\u2019t be online so there\u2019s no pressure. Just sit back, relax, and imagine how you\u2019ll build your future empire.<br><br>Idle but energetic \u2013 While Wasteland Life is heavy on idle game play and resource collection, there\u2019s plenty of excitement as well for players who are looking for something a little more engaging. Head out on expeditions to collect fabulous resources, as these are what will really make or break your ability to sustain your city. But be careful, you don\u2019t know what all awaits you out in the wasteland\u2026<br> <br>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f<b>CAN YOU SURVIVE THE TEST OF TIME</b>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f<br><br>This simulation game sure will test your survival instincts to the max, as you struggle to not only survive, but thrive in this deserted wasteland that was once our planet. Draw up your best strategy and get to work uncovering the land bit by bit, collecting valuable resources along the way that can be used to build houses, settlements, and even cities. Download Wasteland Life now to embark on a thrilling journey of survival and discovery!<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy<br>Terms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use",
